WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.643
MySQL va SQLite da SELECT farqlari

00:12.643 --> 00:25.121
MySQL da HAVING va aliaslar

00:25.121 --> 00:37.398
MySQL FROM DUAL va soxta jadvallar

00:37.398 --> 00:50.330
SQLite da kutilmagan qulaylik: WHERE da alias

00:50.330 --> 01:01.818
SQLite hisob-kitoblari va portabellik xavfi

01:01.818 --> 01:16.380
Uch tizim qiyosiy xulosasi
